ItemDisplay[ID CHSK54>0 STAFF EXC FCR>79 ALLSK>0]: %BORDER-ED%%NAME% %PURPLE%!! %SAGE%[TELE]{%PURPLE%FCR & Teleport Charges Staff}
ItemDisplay[ID CHSK54>0 STAFF FCR>99 ALLSK>0]: %BORDER-ED%%NAME% %PURPLE%!! %SAGE%[TELE]{%PURPLE%FCR & Teleport Charges Staff}
ItemDisplay[ID CHSK357>0 STAFF]: %DOT-97%%NAME% {%ORANGE%(Blink)} // Blink charges

